{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/977881-2e-quick-starts","id":977881,"title":"2e Quick Starts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-28T12:08:33-07:00","id":977881,"title":"2e Quick Starts?","content":"Just something I was wondering after talking with my players recently:<br /> <br /> Is the team at Onyx Path considering any small (and I mean small) Quick Starts for the 2e Chronicles lines? <br /> <br /> After looking at the change of focus in the likes of werewolf, as well as other lines, was thinking some small SAS style one shots would be great to showcase the key features or aspects of a given game (I'm thinking the hunt system for example with Wtf). As well as that, would really help to give a super broad idea of the kind of stories you're telling with that line. <br /> <br /> The answer is likely No, and that's fine, but any thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3192-baileyborough","name":"baileyborough","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T12:19:22-07:00","id":977886,"title":"","content":"Demon has a One-Shot adventure as a quickstart. If I recall correctly it has some pre-made characters, but enough of the rules are there that you can make your own characters if you want. I don't think any of the other lines has a quickstart, though Beast <i>does </i>have a built-in Story set in New Orleans at the back of its corebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T12:36:23-07:00","id":977899,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/114063/Reap-the-Whirlwind\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire has one too</a>. But considering Mage and Werewolf and Beast didn't get one I wouldn't hold your breath. I imagine not enough people used the quickstarts to begin with to make it worthwhile to make.<br /> <br /> I'm sure if they were a huge company they'd be churning out this stuff as fast as people could request it but they have to balance things more carefully now. If you want more of something, let them know you really like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}